{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57204","headline":"十四科头 境照不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 境照不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅师体离无明，烦恼从何处生？\n地狱天堂一相，湼盘生死空名。\n齐无贪嗔可断，亦无佛道可成。\n衆生与佛平等，自然圣智惺惺。\n不爲六尘所染，句句独契无生。\n正觉一念玄解，三世坦然皆平。\n非法非律自制，翛然真入圆成。\n絶此四句百非，如空无作无依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}